<title>USA: TNP files for 1.75 million shares.</title>
<headline>TNP files for 1.75 million shares.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>TNP Enterprises Inc filed Wednesday with the Securities and Exchange Commission for up to 1.75 million common shares.</p>
<p>The holding company said net proceeds will be used for capital contribution to TNP for repayment of certain debt, to provide working capital and for other general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>The offering will be made through Smith Barney Inc, Edward D Jones and Co LP and Legg Mason Wood Walker Inc.</p>
</text>
